that was curiosity-driven,

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.230
and then applications have followed,

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.880
so in the second revolution,

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.778
is it following like, kind of a similar?

00:14:43.778 --> 00:14:45.540
- Absolutely, yeah.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.653
I mean the,

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:53.790
you know, the people that started thinking

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:58.630
