roughly 30 years ago were

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.810
theorists completely disconnected

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:06.870
to the realities of experiment,

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:11.870
and slowly they started
getting some interesting ideas,

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:13.980
other people started paying attention,

00:15:13.980 --> 00:15:15.720
and then people started
thinking about, well,

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.240
maybe there's a way to
actually make these ideas

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:23.240
work in practice, and there's
just huge effort going on now,

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.350
making the technology better and better,

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.960
but still, we've made huge progress,

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.810
but we have a tremendous
way to go before it becomes,

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:35.860
let's say, economically or

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:43.433
important, but we're on
that same route, yeah.

00:15:44.402 --> 00:15:45.570
Yeah.

